  "editNote": "Item parenthesis added from the book: page 186 prints \"(2)\" is the entry's count; the source omits it, and there is no errata for the book. Big boom gun read from the book: page 186 prints \"big boom gun +14 (cobbled; fatal d12; modular B, P, or S; range 20 feet; reload 1), Damage 2d6+2 modular\", and the source split the traits at the commas. The Strike is fatal d12 and modular between bludgeoning, piercing and slashing, with a range of 20 feet and reload 1. The cobbled trait is left off, for the dataset has no record of it; the book explains it only in the sidebar beside the stat block (a misfire on a failed attack unless a DC 5 flat check succeeds), which the record does not carry."
